      ******************************************************************
      *  Group C -- CUST-FILE (random / READ-K)
      *
      *  CUST-FILE has ORGANIZATION INDEXED ACCESS RANDOM (FILE-CONTROL
      *  lines 43-47), so it supports OPEN ('O'), READ-K ('K') keyed
      *  read by RECORD KEY = FD-CUST-ID, and CLOSE ('C').  3000-
      *  CUSTFILE-PROC (CBSTM03B.CBL lines 181-204) differs from the
      *  Group A/B paragraphs in the M03B-READ-K branch, which executes
      *      MOVE LK-M03B-KEY (1:LK-M03B-KEY-LN) TO FD-CUST-ID
      *      READ CUST-FILE INTO LK-M03B-FLDT
      *  before GO TO 3900-EXIT.  The MOVE is a reference-modification
      *  that requires LK-M03B-KEY-LN >= 1 (zero would give an invalid
      *  zero-length range).  TC14/TC17 set LK-M03B-KEY-LN = +9 and
      *  LK-M03B-KEY = '000000001' (9-byte numeric string matching
      *  FD-CUST-ID's PIC X(09) layout per FD lines 71-73).  The READ
      *  itself is stripped to CONTINUE; the MOVE before READ executes
      *  but has no observable side effect on EXPECT-able fields beyond
      *  FD-CUST-ID, which the test does not assert.  Status code '23'
      *  is the canonical "record not found" condition for keyed READ
      *  on INDEXED files (COBOL standard).
      *
      *  Note on CUST-FIXTURE-001 (referenced via depends_on_files):
      *  same rationale as TC2 -- not COPYed at file scope due to
      *  cobol-check 0.2.16 limitations.
      ******************************************************************

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC13 -- 3000-CUSTFILE-PROC OPEN ok returns RC '00'
      *
      *  Production flow: EVALUATE -> 3000-CUSTFILE-PROC -> IF M03B-
      *  OPEN true (line 183) -> OPEN INPUT CUST-FILE (line 184;
      *  stripped) -> GO TO 3900-EXIT -> MOVE CUSTFILE-STATUS TO
      *  LK-M03B-RC (line 201).
      *
      *  Source of expected value
      *    '00' -- the MOVE input from this prelude.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBSTM03B 3000-CUSTFILE-PROC OPEN ok RC 00'
            MOVE 'CUSTFILE' TO LK-M03B-DD
            MOVE 'O'        TO LK-M03B-OPER
            MOVE '00'       TO CUSTFILE-STATUS
            PERFORM 0000-START
            EXPECT LK-M03B-RC TO BE '00'

      ******************************************************************
