      ******************************************************************
      *  Group D -- ACCT-FILE (random / READ-K)
      *
      *  ACCT-FILE has ORGANIZATION INDEXED ACCESS RANDOM (FILE-CONTROL
      *  lines 49-53).  4000-ACCTFILE-PROC (CBSTM03B.CBL lines 206-229)
      *  mirrors 3000-CUSTFILE-PROC's structural shape with two
      *  important differences:
      *    1. RECORD KEY is FD-ACCT-ID (PIC 9(11) -- 11 numeric digits;
      *       FD lines 76-78) rather than FD-CUST-ID's PIC X(09).
      *    2. The reference-modification on M03B-READ-K therefore
      *       requires LK-M03B-KEY-LN = +11 with 11 numeric digits in
      *       LK-M03B-KEY (1:11) so the MOVE to FD-ACCT-ID does not
      *       generate a non-numeric content runtime error.
      *  TC20/TC23 set LK-M03B-KEY-LN = +11 and LK-M03B-KEY (1:11) =
      *  '00000000001' to satisfy this contract.
      *
      *  Note on ACCT-FIXTURE-001 (referenced via depends_on_files):
      *  same rationale as TC2 -- not COPYed at file scope due to
      *  cobol-check 0.2.16 limitations.
      ******************************************************************

