      *  '00000000001' (11 numeric digits) and LK-M03B-KEY-LN = +11
      *  so the production reference-modification at line 214 yields
      *  a valid 11-digit slice for FD-ACCT-ID's PIC 9(11) layout.
      *
      *  Source of expected value
